  "summary": "harmony-app-toolkit preinstall exfiltrates host identity and /etc/passwd to attacker webhook",
  "details": "The package's preinstall lifecycle script reads a hex-encoded command from a sibling preinstall.json file, decodes it with Buffer.from(hexCommand,'hex'), and passes the result to child_process.exec. The decoded command runs curl to POST the output of whoami, pwd, hostname, and the contents of /etc/passwd to the hardcoded endpoint https://eousft8gflamm91.m.pipedream.net. The payload obfuscation (hex-encoded command stored in a data file) hides the destination and command from casual inspection. The exfiltration fires automatically on npm install.",
